# March of the World Ooze: "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, if it's not their turn, you create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token." Bot1
# casts March on turn 1 (Black Lotus and three Moxen) and has a Memnite. Bot2 casts a Phyrexian Walker on its own turn 2: it is that player's turn,
# so no Elephant. On turn 3 Bot1 casts a Giant Growth on its Memnite and Bot2 responds with a Lightning Bolt at Bot1: a spell cast by an opponent on
# a turn that is not its own, so Bot1 creates an Elephant, which March makes a 6/6 Ooze like the other creatures it controls (the token's printed 3/3 is
# replaced by the base 6/6, CR 613.4b). The Elephant resolves first (the trigger is above the Bolt), then the Bolt (Bot1 at 17) and the Giant Growth.

